MODULE: PinOnlyOnBindingRebindKeepsOldPin
TARGET: PinOnlyOnBinding
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a rebind does not release the cursor pin on the pre-swap copy
PERTURBS: Rebind

--- FIND
    /\ pinned' = pinned \ {bound}
    /\ StartRebuild(alias)
    /\ UNCHANGED <<SourceVars, EnvVars, bound, vval, applied, hw, ckpt, pin,
--- REPLACE
    /\ StartRebuild(alias)
    /\ UNCHANGED <<SourceVars, EnvVars, bound, vval, applied, hw, ckpt, pinned, pin,
--- END
